source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
Scaffolds a new project

Usage: leptoskit new [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  The project directory; created when missing. Existing files are never overwritten

Options:
      --platform <PLATFORM>  The platform to target by default [default: web]
      --name <NAME>          The app name; defaults to the directory name
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
